OL,3,AVance's Antichrist comments are a
OL,4,A'common belief', his friend tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent remarks by US Vice-President JD
OL,7,FVance about the Antichrist and "the end
OL,8,Ftimes" are a "very, very common
OL,9,Fbelief", one of his friends says.
OL,11,FVance recently mused on his religious
OL,12,Fviews while responding to a question on
OL,13,Fa Christian podcast. He said he would
OL,14,F"not [be] shocked if the Antichrist was
OL,15,Fwalking among us" and speculated on
OL,16,Fwhether the end of the world was nigh.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
