OL,3,AVance's Antichrist comments are a
OL,4,A'common belief', his friend tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis friend Rod Dreher, a conservative
OL,7,Fwriter, rejected any suggestion that
OL,8,Fthe comments would harm the
OL,9,Fvice-president. He told the BBC's Today
OL,10,Fprogramme: "Most Americans who are
OL,11,Finclined to vote Republican already
OL,12,Fbelieve this stuff."
OL,14,FIn his podcast comments, Vance also
OL,15,Fclarified that such thoughts did not
OL,16,Fpreoccupy him.
